1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,856
Early on a humid morning, look at the leaves of pidalu, or grass.

2
00:00:04,856 --> 00:00:08,736
A row of bright drops stands at the margins and tips.

3
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:17,408
This is guttation: liquid water, not vapour, pushed out through special pores called hydathodes, at the vein endings.

